actics.\par    Analysts say the Canadian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has fundamental\par weaknesses stemming from low commodity prices and global\par uncertainties stemming from the renewed economic and\par financial turmoil in Asia and Russia.\par    The intense pressure on the Canadian dollar is expected\par to last until the pressures originating in Asia relent, or\par the Bank of Canada raises interest rates to defend the\par embattled \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  08-17-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1010EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du8h01ykc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
