\par\par \b \uc2  Canada Morning: C$ Stronger On Fears Of Yen Defense \b0\par\par\uc2 278 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1998\par 15:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar is significantly higher Thursday morning as concerns about the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the yen resulted the U.S. dollar weakening against that \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "We trading kind of tick for tick with (U.S.) dollar/yen," said one \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader with a major Canadian bank. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5145 at 9:49 a.m. EDT (1349 GMT), from C$1.5175 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT) and from C$1.5204 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "There was some interest among IMM types early to buy some Canada," the trader added. "It's pushed (the U.S. dollar) down." \par \par \uc2  Some market watchers suggested the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to be settling in a range after weeks of sustained negative sentiment and then several sessions of volatility after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  beginning \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at unpredictable levels and in varying amounts. \par \par \uc2  "We're just trading around in a range, a consolidation range. We're just bouncing around inside." the trader said. \par \par \uc2  Asked at what level the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday, "Pick a number, any number," was all the trader would say. \par \par \uc2  Some market players said the effectivenes of the bank's surprise \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  was diminishing, as was suggested on the sustained attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  late Wednesday despite the bank again coming into the market. \par \par \uc2  "I think yesterday they jammed it back through the bank. They discovered the bank wasn't there with a hammer. They were just there with usual amounts," the trader said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 13-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1351GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8d06vyb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
