\par\par \b \uc2  Canada dollar opens firmer as dollar/yen falls. \b0\par\par\uc2 462 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 15:41\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORECAST RANGE   1.5100/1.5230\tab ASIAN CLOSE    1.5215\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  US$ SUPPORT 1.5050 RESISTANCE 1.5355  HIGH 1.5238 LOW 1.5118 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par CANADA OPEN 1.5133 HIGH 1.5190\tab EUROPE OPEN    1.5204\par PREV CLOSE  1.5224 LOW  1.5113\tab HIGH 1.5230 LOW 1.5120\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par WEDNESDAY, AUGUST 12\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TREND: NEUTRAL, ACTIVITY: MODERATE\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *Canada's dollar opened one Canadian cent firmer vs U.S. dollar\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par at C$1.5133 (US$0.6608), piggybacking on sharp rise in yen vs\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par U.S. dollar triggered by growing fears of BOJ \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *Market watching for Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in early trade\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par following three consecutive business days of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  buying.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *BOC releases quarterly review on economy this morning.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TORONTO, Aug 12 (Reuters) - The Canadian dollar opened 100 points firmer at C$1.5133 (US$0.6608) on Wednesday, piggybacking on a sharp overnight rise in the yen against the U.S. dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Stable Canada buying during European and early North American trading pushed up the local dollar before it slipped a bit as traders covered some short U.S. dollar positions.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There seemed to be broad-based interest to sell U.S. dollars," one trader said. "I think we broke through some technical levels around C$1.5160/65 (US$0.6596/0.65940)."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The market was awaiting the possibility of action by the Bank of Canada to boost the dollar through money market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 0900 EDT/1300 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "But of course, nothing happened, so people are selling a bit of Canada since then," the trader said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Now the market is watching to see if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will take another pre-emptive step and buy up the Canadian dollar before the U.S. dollar gains against it.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On Tuesday, the bank stepped into the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market in early trading to sell U.S. dollars at C$1.5230 (US$0.6566), attacking U.S. bulls for the third straight business day.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In cross trading, the Canadian unit rose to 1.1708 marks after 1.1695 marks at the previous close here, but fell to 96.20 yen after 96.70 yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yen jumped two yen against the U.S. dollar overnight on growing fears that the Bank of Japan would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to sten the yen's decline.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  today releases its quarterly review of the economy at around 1130 EDT/1530 GMT, and minutes of a board meeting at 1400 EDT/1800 GMT.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For indications of the overall strength of the Canadian economy, second quarter gross domestic product (GDP) and current account data will be watched when they are released on August 31.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (Masaru Sato, Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107, toronto.newsroom@reuters.com))\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du8c0305h\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
