ghlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Tuesday morning to cap the U.S. dollar's gain at C$1.5230 (US$0.6566). \par \par \uc2  ((Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107, toronto.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du8c02y96\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
