\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Repeated  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Seen \b0\par\par\uc2 227 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 21:19\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market repeatedly Wednesday afternoon, selling U.S. dollars at C$1.5173 and C$1.5178 and at higher levels as the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept moving higher, said a Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar levelled off briefly after the \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but was hovering at C$1.5190 at 3:14 p.m. EDT (1914 GMT). \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the third round reported on Wednesday, and follows two earlier \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at around C$1.5168 earlier in the day. \par \par \uc2  The second and third \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  came after the U.S. dollar started to climb upward - particularly against the Deutsche mark - in a move that global \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  watchers attributed to concerns about a possible devaluation of the Russian ruble. \par \par \uc2  Traders reported that the third round saw a return to the bank's characteristic response in cases of sustained pressure against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  usually \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  at each five-tick advance recorded by the U.S. dollar against the Canadian dollar. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sources reported seeing a pattern of repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday afternoon as part of he third \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and they expected the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  at each five-tick move. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires  08-12-98 \par \par \uc2  1519EDT \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du8c01w3g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
