\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Of  \highlight22\uc2 Canada Intervenes \highlight\uc2  -2: Second Round Reported \b0\par\par\uc2 363 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 August 1998\par 20:44\par \uc2  Capital Markets Report \par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market Wednesday afternoon, selling\par U.S. dollars at C$1.5168, said a trader in Toronto.\par    The U.S. dollar leveled off after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and\par was hovering at C$1.5160 at 2:36 p.m. EDT (1836 GMT).\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  was the second round reported on\par Wednesday, and follows an earlier \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  around the\par same levels late at the morning.\par    The second move came after the U.S. dollar started to\par climb upwards - particularly against the Deutsche mark - in\par a move that global \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  watchers attributed to concerns\par about a possible devaluation of the Russia ruble.\par    The U.S. dollar, which closed at C$1.5224 Tuesday, has\par been fairly stable against the Canadian dollar in the\par latter part of the session.\par    It was pushed lower overnight after hints of possible\par Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in defense of the yen against the\par U.S. dollar, and slipped as low as C$1.5117 at 8:02 a.m.\par EDT (1202 GMT).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  It hovered in a broad range around C$1.5140\par for most of the morning before heading higher just prior to\par the first \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    It stabilized again around C$1.5145 for most of the\par afternoon, but then started to pushed higher in period\par leading up to the second \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    Both \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Wednesday followed the Bank of\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's recent pattern of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets\par much earlier than its previous \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  policy would\par dictate.\par    The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's previous unofficial policy was to\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets after intraday moves in\par either direction of 70 ticks or more in order to contain\par volatility, But beginning last Friday, the bank began a\par pattern of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market early and at\par unpredictable levels.\par    The bank's new approach to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is designed to\par create a "two-way flow" in the Canadian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which had\par been under severe downward pressure in recent weeks,\par analysts say.\par    Many analysts believe the strong negative sentiment\par against the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  persists despite the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  08-12-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1444EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du8c01w1a\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
