dnesday. Even so, the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  twice Wednesday at the level of CS$1.5168, which indicated to traders that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would like to see a stronger Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  (For more detail on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, please see page 1033.) \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2029GMT \par \par \uc2  1074 28038 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8c06swh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
