\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  dollar ends firmer on back of  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 938 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1998\par 01:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par FORECAST RANGE   1.5130/1.5250\tab ASIAN CLOSE    1.5215\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  US$ SUPPORT 1.5100  RESISTANCE 1.5350 HIGH 1.5251 LOW 1.5193 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par CANADA OPEN 1.5233 HIGH 1.5239\tab EUROPE OPEN    1.5222\par PREV CLOSE  1.5218 LOW  1.5150\tab HIGH 1.5240 LOW 1.5190\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ------------------------------------------------------------\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par MONDAY, AUGUST 10\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TREND: NEUTRAL, ACTIVITY: MODERATE\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *Canada's dollar ended firmer at C$1.5178 (US$0.6588), maintaining some gains\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par from Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to buy up Canadian dollars in the morning.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *U.S. dollar hit a day's low of C$1.5150 (US$0.6601) after reaching day's high\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par of C$1.5239 (US$0.6562), where \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  stepped in before waiting to see if\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par there would be a sharper rise in U.S. dollar. *Canada's higher yields over U.S.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par seen helping CAD. *U.S. dollar steady above 146 yen, but cut overnight gains.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par *Canada July housing starts due Tuesday, U.S. July retail sales Thursday, July\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par PPI/industrial output Friday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par TORONTO, Aug 10 (Reuters) - The Canadian dollar ended firmer at C$1.5178 (US$0.6588) on Monday after \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , closing higher against the U.S. dollar for two trading days in a row.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Following massive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market on Friday, the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on Monday morning to pound the U.S. dollar from a day's high of C$1.5239 (US$0.6562) to a day's low of C$1.5150 (US$0.6601).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The bank has shifted to more flexible, pre-emptive tactics from its previous, predictable strategy of pegging buy-\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Canada intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to a 70-point rise in the U.S. dollar above the previous day's close.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Monday's action was less aggressive than Friday's, in which the bank sold a large sum of U.S. dollars at various levels, pushing up the Canadian dollar by nearly 250 points. About half of that gain was lost by the end of Friday's session.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Despite successful \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , it is still uncertain whether the Canadian dollar has reversed its five-month downtrend.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The U.S. dollar has remained bullish against the yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The yen's weakness has been sparked by the market's impatience with the slow progress of reform and economic recovery in Japan, and this has in the past spilled over into U.S. dollar/Canada trading.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On the other hand, the Canadian dollar appeared to get some help from rising yields on Canadian bonds as their prices continued to fall. The yields are now higher than those on U.S. bonds in many areas along the yield curve from short to long terms.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Certainly the elimination of the interest rates spread between Canada and the U.S. should give some support to the Canadian dollar," said Robert Fairholm, chief Canadian economist at Standard & Poor's DRI. "The transition (to positive spreads) is partly a reflection in changing sentiment in the Canadian exchange market, but it feeds back into helping the Canadian dollar."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Higher returns on U.S. dollar assets and safe-haven capital flows have boosted the U.S. dollar against key \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , including the Canadian dollar. The market has attributed the underlying weakness of the Canadian dollar to lower returns on Canadian securities.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Now that that factor is disappearing, the focus is on how the Bank of Canada will help stabilise the local dollar and how investors will look at Canada's growth potential through economic indicators.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par    "We believe the Canadian dollar will now be stabilised at current levels\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par and yields, and we expect the depreciation trend will be broken with no need\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par for a hike in the bank rate," Carl Weinberg, chief economist at High Frequency\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Economics, said in a report.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Canadian yields from 90 days to 10 years have surpassed U.S. yields for the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par first time since February 1997, he said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     One factor helping stabilise the local dollar was the release on Friday of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Canada's July jobs data, which showed higher-than-expected growth. Canada's\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par dollar has come under pressure from soft commodity prices sparked by the Asian\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par crisis, and more recently worries over a slower pace of domestic economic\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par growth.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     Canada's July housing starts data will be released at 0815 EDT/1215 GMT on\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     In cross trading, the Canadian unit recovered from initial declines and\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par firmed to 1.1705 marks from 1.1696 marks at the previous close here, and edged\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par up to 96.31 yen after 96.07 yen.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The Japanese \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's weakness against the U.S. dollar could spill over\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par into dollar/Canada trading.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     The market is once again disappointed with the slow progress of banking\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par system reform in Japan. Japanese Prime Minister Keizo Obuchi, reading a\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par prepared text, told parliament on Monday that Japan's economy was in serious\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par slump but did not offer any new ideas on how to tackle the problems prolonging\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par the recession. He read the text during a question-and-answer period at the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par plenary session in parliament. This is considered a formality before lawmakers\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par get down to more serious and spontaneous debates at key committees later.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Flight to quality capital is seen flowing into U.S. dollar assets as the\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par market is also nervous about the possibility of a devaluation of the Chinese\par \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , the yuan. Such a measure to boost China' export competitive edge\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par could trigger similar actions by other Asian nations and prompt withdrawal of\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par short-term capital from the region.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     (Masaru Sato, Reuters Toronto newsroom (416) 941-8107,\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par toronto.newsroom@reuters.com))\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021113du8a02tfy\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
