\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Late Morning -2: C$ Firms On BOC  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 341 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 1998\par 16:58\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar is stronger against its U.S. counterpart following another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  Monday morning, but traders indicated sustained \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  selling of U.S. dollars will likely be necessary to keep the Canadian unit from resuming its slide. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5174 at 10:55 a.m. EDT (1455 GMT), from C$1.5216 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT) and from C$1.5212 late Friday. The U.S. unit fell as low as C$1.5152 immediately following the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but began inching up again soon afterward. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market sources said the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  thus far has come in one large wave, with the bank selling U.S. dollars beginning at C$1.5230 and continuing down through the C$1.5150 level. \par \par \uc2  "The market retracted some U.S. dollar gains on the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but you can see that this market is very long U.S.," said a trader at a Canadian bank. "It's a bit of a David versus Goliath situation - until the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  takes more permanent action on interest rates, it'll probably have to keep \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  Most said the scale of Monday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was smaller than its actions on Friday, when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold hundreds of millions of US dollars in at least three seperate waves to shore up the Canadian dollar. \par \par \uc2  Friday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  allowed the Canadian unit to initially retrace about 240 points against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , while Monday's resulted in a narrower retracement of less than 80 points. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par These are the exchange rates at 10:55 a.m. EDT (1455 GMT), 8:00 a.m.\par EDT (1200 GMT), and late Friday.\par    U.S./CDN    1.5174      1.5216   1.5212\par    CDN/DEM     1.1717      1.1170   1.1701\par    CDN/YEN     96.51       96.20    96.11\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-08-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1458GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8a06rp7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
