\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Morning: C$ Surges After Dramatic BOC  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1998\par 16:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TORONTO (Dow Jones)--The Canadian dollar is dramatically higher Friday morning after the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada\b0 \highlight\uc2  launched an an extensive series of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dragging the U.S. dollar from around C$1.5355 to C$1.5131 in about 45 minutes. \par \par \uc2  "They came in at C$1.5355, they smashed all the bids all the way down to the figure - that was the first round," said one trader with a major Canadian bank. \par \par \uc2  "After that, they came in again, all the way down to (a U.S. dollar level) of C$1.5250, it popped back to (C$1.5280)." \par \par \uc2  A third round brought the U.S. dollar to its levels around C$1.5140. "I don't know if they're done yet, or not, but I think they will get it below (a U.S. dollar level of C$1.5100," he added. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5180 at 10:15 a.m. EDT (1415 GMT), from C$1.5300 at 8:00 a.m. EDT (1200 GMT) and from C$1.5288 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  While the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets Thursday, when the attack on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  seemed to intensify, it adhered to its usual policy and its usual operating methods. \par \par \uc2  But some market watchers reported the the central stepped outside its normal \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  channels Friday and involved several additional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  brokers, including some in London. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 07-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1418GMT \par \par \uc2  1158 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8706ppd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
