\par\par \b \uc2  World  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : -3: Repeated  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  To Aid  \highlight22\uc2 Canada \highlight\uc2  Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 311 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 August 1998\par 23:27\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Weakened by speculation, the Hong Kong dollar traded lower at HK$7.7490, compared withHK$7.7499 late Wednesday. HK$7.7500 is typically the level at which the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  steps into the market, according to traders. \par \par \uc2  In Southeast Asia, the heightened speculative pressure on the Hong Kong dollar pressured the region's \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Traders sold down the Singapore dollar, Malaysian ringgit and Thai baht on the expectation that the unpegging of the Hong Kong dollar would trigger a shock wave of further \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation throughout the region. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, repeated Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Canada intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  failed again to lift the ailing Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  off its lows. Canada's dollar finished the day significantly lower after selling pressure intensified, prompting repeated \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Traders said the pressure accelerated on the Canadian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as speculators sold it for U.S. dollars. \par \par \uc2  The descent of the Canadian dollar, which has been hard hit by falling commodity prices, has intensified speculation that the bank of Canada may be compelled to raise rates to defend the embattled \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Late in New York, the U.S. dollar was trading at C$1.5294 from C$1.5185 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In the U.K., sterling regained some of the losses sustained after U.K.'s Monetary Policy Committee left the repo rate unchanged at 7.50% and following the release of some weak economic data, traders said. \par \par \uc2  "The bank was not expected to tighten; it's not a big surprise, but it does indicate that rates have reached their peak in the U.K." said Barclay's Willmore. \par \par \uc2  SUBSCRIBERS: International economic indicators and the U.S. Treasury commentary previously contained in this report are available on pages 1001 and 4041 or under news retrieval codes n/iei and n/bon. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 06-08-98 \par \par \uc2  2127GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8606ojp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
