Asia relents, or the Bank of Canada raises interest rates to\par defend the embattled \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par    Most market watchers also point to sustained negative\par yield spreads between Canada and the U.S. as a key reason for\par the Canadian dollar's weakness.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires  07-15-98\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 1452EDT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  4346 \par \par \uc2 Dokument cm00000020010916du7f01pkj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
